p.la mÃºsica.consejo: Feminine noun with an accent on the u.
p.los libros.glosa: the books
p.los libros.consejo: Masculine plural noun.
p.a mÃ­ tambiÃ©n.glosa: me too
p.a mÃ­ tambiÃ©n.consejo: To agree with an affirmative statement.
p.a mÃ­ tampoco.glosa: me neither
p.a mÃ­ tampoco.consejo: To agree with a negative statement.
p.a mÃ­ sÃ­.glosa: I do
p.a mÃ­ sÃ­.consejo: To disagree with a previous negative statement.
p.a mÃ­ no.glosa: I don't
p.a mÃ­ no.consejo: To disagree with a previous positive statement.
p.nada.glosa: not at all / nothing
p.nada.consejo: Reinforces negation: no me gusta nada.
